     Watson.

BBUUGGSS
     aalltteerraa__aavvggeenn is intended to support the writing of userspace device driv‐
     ers; however, it does not permit directing interrupts to userspace, only
     memory-mapped I/O.

     aalltteerraa__aavvggeenn supports only a nexus bus attachment, which is appropriate
     for system-on-chip busses such as Altera's Avalon bus.  If the target de‐
     vice is off of another bus type, then additional bus attachments will be
     required.

